# Hual04c input route (UU/seconds): cable-car ride, ladder, grapple descent, ground escort.
# No teleports, grants, goal writes or control overrides.
# The game's HUD finishes its own slide-out and emits EndCartoonEffect; Telepherique0
# rides to its first point, explodes and returns control at ~24.983 s.
# Jump before crossing the open floor trap: walking off drops ~2000 UU (-114 HP).
# item91b: current collider poses also affect the cinematic's carried player.
# Enter the south-facing ladder and move east within it. The intact cabin ceiling
# stops the initial climb; keep upward input until the authored cabin fall (~70s).
# Select the game's Hook, lock HookPoint1, release fire, then use alt-fire to descend.
# Release with use near the ground, avoiding the old 114HP uncontrolled fall.
# Current wreck mesh replaces intact world collision; walk to Carrington, whose
# TouchTrigger4 starts the escort. Follow his first waypoints by ordinary input.
# Next encounter: action27 waits for move_move_02 (first combat-clear event).
# Direct entry supplies Fists/Hook/LockPick, not the campaign rifle: selection14
# leaves Fists. Longer melee/cover explorations failed or harmed Carrington;
# this fixture pins the surviving escort/first-encounter prefix at125s.
# This is not a completed helicopter mission or a claim that combat is impossible.
# Goals 0/2/3 and kello01a travel remain unreached; completed goals 1/4/5/6 are
# authored anti-goals, not accomplishments of this route.
